```java
// Java 17 with Spring Boot 3.3.1 and spring-boot-starter-web.
@SpringBootApplication
public class OrderApplication {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        SpringApplication.run(OrderApplication.class, args);
    }
}

@RestController                       // Spring MVC annotation
@RequestMapping("/api/orders")
class OrderController {
    @GetMapping
    List<Order> all() {
        return List.of(new Order(1L, "book"));
    }
}

record Order(Long id, String item) {}
```

The controller uses Spring MVC. With the web starter present, Boot can configure the dispatcher, JSON conversion, and embedded Tomcat around it.

```xml
